# Trivy ignore file
# -----------------
# List CVE IDs here (one per line) to accept a vulnerability that Trivy would
# otherwise report as HIGH/CRITICAL and use to fail the build, e.g.
#
#   CVE-2023-12345   # false positive: vulnerable function not used, reviewed by <name> on <date>
#
# It is intentionally EMPTY: every HIGH/CRITICAL finding must be fixed, not
# ignored. Any entry added here should be justified in the pull request.
